Sval: Include the string traits PageLoadEventUtils.h uses

PageLoadEventUtils.h writes and reads an nsCString through ParamTraits
but includes only IPCMessageUtils.h, so it compiles only after something
else has included IPCMessageUtilsSpecializations.h. nsImageLoadingContent
got that from PContent.h, which it stops including once text
recognition goes.

